{
  "name": "dsh-model-doctor",
  "version": "0.5.3",
  "description": "模型医生：在对话输入区的模型选择菜单里，为每个模型选项追加「连通检测」与「删除」按钮——直接适配 DSH 官方模型菜单（按官方 DOM 契约精确定位，不依赖任何菜单渲染插件），检测直连各网关探测连通性/欠费/额度，删除直接从 llm-pi-ai 配置移除模型（自动备份配置文档）。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "model-selector",
    "connectivity",
    "balance",
    "ui"
  ],
  "author": "lxy33",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client/index.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ]
    }
  }
}